</pre>
<span id="A2.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Gold Answer:<span id="A2.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
