<span id="A2.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Helpful Information:<span id="A2.SS2.p1.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> There is ample case law interpreting what constitutes “good cause or excusable neglect” under Rule 1.070(j). Some examples include:</span></span></span>
